# Seed manifest for seed-local-files.sh — one path per line, relative to the repo root.
#
# Blank lines and lines whose first non-space character is '#' are ignored. A path that
# resolves to a DIRECTORY in the source is rsync'd (merged, no delete); a FILE is copied.
# Missing paths are skipped.
#
# List ONLY gitignored, local-only artifacts that a fresh clone / `git worktree add` does
# NOT materialize. A directory entry copies EVERYTHING under it — keep branch WIP out of
# listed dirs, or pass a narrower list with --manifest and preview with --dry-run.
#
# Replace the examples below with your project's paths. Do NOT list deps/caches
# (node_modules, .venv, *_cache) — regenerate those instead.

.env
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills

# apps/web/.env.local
# data/fixtures
